# Build contexts: `review/`, `cleaners/` and `tide/` are built from the repository root because
# they need files outside their own directory (`src/` for the reviewer, `common/` for the
# products that file issues).
# Nothing in the image comes from these, and shipping them means uploading a dependency tree and
# a git database on every build.
node_modules
.git
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
